TEST 3 COMPLETE — Review above
========================================
Compare the sign of each measurement against expected.
Any sign flip = axis alignment bug in ALIGN_xx macros.

Quick reference (MuJoCo NWU convention):
  Nose down:     ax>0, pitch<0
  Right down:    roll>0
  CW rotation:   gz<0, yaw decreasing

